# ai-dev-workstation - Environment Variables
# Optional reference for local MCP credentials; not loaded by setup.sh or VS Code.
# See docs/mcp.md for VS Code/WSL environment setup. Never commit real credentials.

# Context7 MCP server (up-to-date library docs/context lookup)
# Get a key at https://context7.com/
CONTEXT7_API_KEY=your_context7_api_key_here

# Brave Search MCP server (web search)
# Get a key at https://api.search.brave.com/
BRAVE_API_KEY=your_brave_search_api_key_here
